      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Cogumelo. Shroomish prefere lugares úmidos. Durante o dia, permanece imóvel à sombra das florestas e libera um pó tóxico pela cabeça. Quando percebe algum perigo, espalha esporos pelo topo da cabeça para se proteger.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Fada, Grama &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Shroomish pode evoluir para Breloom no nível 8 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Absorb, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Stun Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Leech Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Mega Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Poison Powder</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Worry Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Giga Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Growth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Toxic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Seed Bomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Spore</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Body Slam, Bullet Seed, Charm, Confide, Double Team, Drain Punch, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Fake Tears, False Swipe, Focus Punch, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Terrain, Gunk Shot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Magical Leaf, Pounce, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Snatch, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Venoshock, Worry Seed, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Bullet Seed, Charm, Drain Punch, Fake Tears, Focus Punch, Helping Hand, Natural Gift, Seed Bomb, Wake-Up Slap, Worry Seed</p>",
